    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>This plugin is a bloat-free collection of essential blocks for landing pages, product pages, articles, documentation, and service websites.</p>\n<p>Plugin extends the native WordPress block editor with a focused set of practical blocks. It keeps your existing editing workflow intact instead of introducing another page-building interface.</p>\n<h4>Why this plugin?</h4>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Focused by design:</strong> Get practical marketing and content blocks without an oversized block library.</li>\n<li><strong>Native Gutenberg workflow:</strong> Create and edit content with the familiar WordPress block editor.</li>\n<li><strong>No separate builder layer:</strong> Keep your existing editing workflow, interface, and content structure.</li>\n<li><strong>Use only what you need:</strong> Enable or disable individual blocks from the plugin settings.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Free Blocks</h4>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Author Box Advanced:</strong> Build an SEO-focused author profile with credentials and links.</li>\n<li><strong>Call to Action:</strong> Highlight one clear next step with focused supporting copy.</li>\n<li><strong>Checklist:</strong> Create editable checklist cards with status labels and completion states.</li>\n<li><strong>Countdown Timer:</strong> Run fixed-date or evergreen countdowns for offers and launches.</li>\n<li><strong>List with Icons:</strong> Present concise list items with a consistent shared icon.</li>\n<li><strong>Note:</strong> Highlight important information with clear supporting text.</li>\n<li><strong>Table of Contents:</strong> Generate navigation automatically from the headings in a post or page.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Smart Marketing Blocks Pro</h4>\n<p>Need more options? The Pro version expands the focused collection with:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Coupon / Promo Code:</strong> Display a promo code with a copy action, call to action, details link, and expiry text.</li>\n<li><strong>Dynamic Carousel:</strong> Build a carousel from selected media or a posts query.</li>\n<li><strong>Logo Carousel:</strong> Show logos in a seamless scrolling row.</li>\n<li><strong>Posts Grid:</strong> Create responsive post grids with query controls and AJAX pagination.</li>\n<li><strong>Pricing Table:</strong> Compare pricing plans with editable features and call-to-action buttons.</li>\n<li><strong>Pros and Cons:</strong> Present a balanced two-column summary.</li>\n<li><strong>Tabs:</strong> Organize editable inner blocks into tabbed content panels.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>See the upgrade options in your WordPress dashboard when you are ready for the Pro blocks.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>In your WordPress dashboard, go to <code>Plugins &gt; Add New</code> and search for &#8220;VovaBlocks &#8211; Smart Marketing Blocks&#8221;, or upload the official plugin ZIP.</li>\n<li>Install and activate the plugin.</li>\n<li>Go to <code>Pages &gt; Add New</code> to create a new page.</li>\n<li>Click the <code>+</code> button to open the block inserter.</li>\n<li>Find the <code>VovaBlocks</code> category and choose the block you want to add.</li>\n<li>Optional: Go to <code>VovaBlocks &gt; Settings</code> to enable or disable individual blocks.</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id=\"does%20the%20plugin%20add%20its%20own%20page%20builder%3F\">\nDoes the plugin add its own page builder?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>No. It extends the native WordPress block editor and keeps the familiar Gutenberg editing workflow instead of adding a separate page-building interface.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"can%20i%20disable%20blocks%20i%20do%20not%20use%3F\">\nCan I disable blocks I do not use?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes. Go to <code>VovaBlocks &gt; Settings</code>, enable the blocks you need, and disable the rest.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"does%20the%20free%20version%20work%20without%20pro%3F\">\nDoes the free version work without Pro?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes. Every block listed in the Free Blocks section works independently. Pro adds more specialized blocks but is not required to use the free collection.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"does%20the%20plugin%20connect%20to%20an%20external%20service%3F\">\nDoes the plugin connect to an external service?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>The plugin uses <a href=\"https://freemius.com/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Freemius</a> for optional usage-data sharing, license management, and Pro upgrades. When the plugin is activated, you can skip usage-data sharing and all free blocks will continue to work. If you opt in, Freemius receives the information described on the consent screen. Purchasing or activating Pro requires a connection to Freemius. Read the <a href=\"https://freemius.com/terms/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Freemius Terms</a> and <a href=\"https://freemius.com/privacy/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial WordPress.org release.</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Bloat-free marketing blocks for Gutenberg - focused, practical, and nothing you don&#039;t need.",
    "description": "<p>This plugin is a bloat-free collection of essential blocks for landing pages, product pages, articles, documentation, and service websites.</p>\n<p>Plugin extends the native WordPress block editor with a focused set of practical blocks. It keeps your existing editing workflow intact instead of introducing another page-building interface.</p>\n<h4>Why this plugin?</h4>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Focused by design:</strong> Get practical marketing and content blocks without an oversized block library.</li>\n<li><strong>Native Gutenberg workflow:</strong> Create and edit content with the familiar WordPress block editor.</li>\n<li><strong>No separate builder layer:</strong> Keep your existing editing workflow, interface, and content structure.</li>\n<li><strong>Use only what you need:</strong> Enable or disable individual blocks from the plugin settings.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Free Blocks</h4>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Author Box Advanced:</strong> Build an SEO-focused author profile with credentials and links.</li>\n<li><strong>Call to Action:</strong> Highlight one clear next step with focused supporting copy.</li>\n<li><strong>Checklist:</strong> Create editable checklist cards with status labels and completion states.</li>\n<li><strong>Countdown Timer:</strong> Run fixed-date or evergreen countdowns for offers and launches.</li>\n<li><strong>List with Icons:</strong> Present concise list items with a consistent shared icon.</li>\n<li><strong>Note:</strong> Highlight important information with clear supporting text.</li>\n<li><strong>Table of Contents:</strong> Generate navigation automatically from the headings in a post or page.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Smart Marketing Blocks Pro</h4>\n<p>Need more options? The Pro version expands the focused collection with:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Coupon / Promo Code:</strong> Display a promo code with a copy action, call to action, details link, and expiry text.</li>\n<li><strong>Dynamic Carousel:</strong> Build a carousel from selected media or a posts query.</li>\n<li><strong>Logo Carousel:</strong> Show logos in a seamless scrolling row.</li>\n<li><strong>Posts Grid:</strong> Create responsive post grids with query controls and AJAX pagination.</li>\n<li><strong>Pricing Table:</strong> Compare pricing plans with editable features and call-to-action buttons.</li>\n<li><strong>Pros and Cons:</strong> Present a balanced two-column summary.</li>\n<li><strong>Tabs:</strong> Organize editable inner blocks into tabbed content panels.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>See the upgrade options in your WordPress dashboard when you are ready for the Pro blocks.</p>\n",
